            "number": "59",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:59"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "59",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Zedekia akaba aina omusigirewe omukuru ow'omu kikaare, nayetwa Seraya mutabani wa Neria, Neria eya Mahaseya. Nikwo bagenzire hamoi Babiloni, omu mwaka gwa kanai Zedekia omukama wa Yuda aliire engoma. Seraya ogwo, nyina ebyo namuragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.59",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.59"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "60",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:60"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "60",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkahandika omu kitabo enaku zona ezabaire nizija kugwera Babiloni. N'ebindi byona ebyabaire bikwete ahali Babiloni nkabihandika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.60",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.60"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "61",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:61"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "61",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seraya nkamugambira nti, “Orwo oragoba Babiloni, obashomere ebigambo ebi byona, oti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.61",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.61"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "62",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:62"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "62",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Waitu Mukama, ogambire okwo ensi egi olikwija kugisilikya, okwo etaturwemu kantu, yaba muntu anga nyamaishwa, ehinduke matongo ebiro byona.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.62"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "63",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:63"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "63",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'oramara kubashomera ekitabo eki, okikomeho eibare, okitokye omu Mwiga gwa Efurati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.63",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.63"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "64",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 51:64"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "64",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogambe oti, ‘Oku nikwo Babiloni eratoka, obutatokorogoka rundi, aha rw'enshonga y'enaku ezo ndikwija kugiteza.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.51.64",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.51.64"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
